user_prompt:
Validate this set of coded lines for compliance before claim submission. Each line may include a CPT/HCPCS code, modifier(s), units, and/or ICD-10-CM diagnosis code(s) — parse them from the raw input below (one code/line per row; formats seen include "99214-25-E11.69,I10,E78.5,D64.9" and "G0446-59-I10", i.e. CPT-MODIFIER-DX1,DX2,...).

Confirmed NCCI PTP edits for this code set (ground truth — from an authoritative local dataset, already checked in both code-pair directions and across both the practitioner and outpatient-hospital code sets; empty means no confirmed edits were found among these codes, not that none exist):
{{ptp_edits_found}}

Split every input line into either valid_codes or invalid_codes (never both). For any line moved to invalid_codes, also add a matching entry to code_conflicts and/or issues explaining why, and add the corrected version of that line (or its omission) to final_codes so final_codes always reflects your recommended, compliant code set. Return ONLY this JSON object (no markdown, no extra text):
{
  "valid_codes": [
    {"cpt_code": "", "modifier": "", "units": 1, "icd_codes": [], "description": ""}
  ],
  "invalid_codes": [
    {"cpt_code": "", "modifier": "", "units": 1, "icd_codes": [], "description": "", "issue_type": "PTP_EDIT|MUE|ADD_ON_MISSING_PRIMARY|MODIFIER_REQUIRED|UNSPECIFIED_DIAGNOSIS|OTHER", "reason": ""}
  ],
  "final_codes": [
    {"cpt_code": "", "modifier": "", "units": 1, "icd_codes": [], "description": ""}
  ],
  "code_conflicts": [
    {"code_a": "", "code_b": "", "conflict_type": "PTP_EDIT|MUE|OTHER", "description": "", "resolution": ""}
  ],
  "issues": [
    {"code": "", "issue": "", "severity": "error|warning|info", "recommendation": ""}
  ],
  "recommended_changes": [
    {"code": "", "change": "", "reason": ""}
  ],
  "summary": "",
  "coding_year": "",
  "denial_risk": "Low|Medium|High"
}

coded_input:
{{coded_input}}
